</center><H1 ALIGN=CENTER> Beastmaster Guild Info</H1>

<BLOCKQUOTE>
<br><hr><br>
<pre>


Joribund gives you some information about the guild.
Name: The Herd of Beastmasters
Command: beastmaster
Creators: Shinarae and Elwood
Maximum level: 15


Description:
Some would argue that what makes humans, elves, orcs, and other races more
than mere animals is not fire, or steel, or even magic, but their ability to
enslave animals and train them for service. The Beastmasters are throwbacks to
those ancient times when hunting and capturing wild beasts was a necessity of
life. They yoke the fiercest of beasts to harness their strength, and can even
use their power in combat if need be.


Joining requirements:
 Background must be nomad (wrong or incomplete)
 Must be maximum level in Squire (not a member)
Abilities gained when joining:
 You receive a pair of nasty barbed spurs.
 May train skill Short blades to 9%
 May train skill Bludgeons to 9%
 May train skill Whips to 9%
 May train skill Kick to 19%
 May train skill Hiking to 9%
 May train skill Alertness to 4%
 May train skill Plant lore to 9%
 May train skill Riding to 9%
 May train skill Butchering to 19%
 May train skill Rebuke to 19%
 May train skill Refit mount gear to 19%
 May train skill Tame mount to 9%
 May train skill Evaluate mount to 28%
 May train skill Combat riding to 4%


